{"version":1,"content":"<p>英國國防承包商BAE Systems近日在巴黎舉行的Euronaval 2026海軍防務展上，展示了全新的Sea Tridon系列40毫米艦炮系統。這套武器最大的特點是採用模塊化設計，其中部分型號甚至可以直接安裝在標準集裝箱尺寸的模塊上，無需對艦船進行大規模改造，就能迅速獲得額外的海上防禦能力。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585476.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.639726+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":153,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T09:13:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_hash":"4c6f270f3ba3a8ad1dad4027458337bdd9c47bdde7c7f8e9b738a1de2ba73401","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}